  "comments": "<p>The standard weight of these pieces was 48 to the pound or one third ounce avoirdupois (145.8 grains).<br><br>'H' mintmark struck by Ralph Heaton &amp; Sons, Birmingham (Sp#3955), all other issues are Sp#3954<br><br>In 1874, the 2nd portrait was very slightly changed. In KM#755, the D:G: is further away from the Queen's head.<br>So take care if you have an 1874 in case it is KM#749.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The 1880 variant</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6957e08173b66.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6957e08173b66.jpg\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>How to count number of leaves on the wreath:<br>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/67a3bc4e587b9.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/67a3bc4e587b9.jpg\"></a></p>",
